# FSA C++ Falsification Controls

This tool implements internal falsification vectors to verify logic robustness.

## FV-1: Mismatch Injection
Injecting a `mismatch_rate > 0` should accelerate the decay of `active_count`.

## FV-2: Residue Barrier Stability
Setting `res_req` to a massive value should block all agents from progressing beyond the threshold node, resulting in immediate collapse.
